  * `set [inspected v] to [0]`
  *  set [accepted v] to [0]`
  *  set [rejected v] to [0]`
  * `repeat (10)`
      * set [diameter v] to (pick random (24.90) to (25.10))`
      * change [inspected v] by (1)`
